1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,760
Junho, this is my first time opening a bank account, and I'm not sure what I need.

2
00:00:08,110 --> 00:00:15,310
Oh, I see. Usually you need an ID, and people also bring a seal stamp. I opened one last month too.

3
00:00:15,660 --> 00:00:19,380
Oh, really? But what if I don't have a seal stamp?

4
00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:26,050
It's fine if you don't have one. These days, you can just sign instead of using a stamp, so don't worry.

5
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:32,679
Oh, that's a relief. So is just one form of ID enough for opening an account?

6
00:00:33,029 --> 00:00:39,949
Usually an ID is enough, but some banks might ask for additional documents. You should check before you go.
